catflow 0.8
1. Template    "Compare our 2025 and 2026 PTO policies. What changed?"
2. <list react_agent>
     1. Read Index               kb.index
     2. Think        (input:1)   Qwen3 8B; tools: search, calculate, final; max_visits=8; on_budget=final
        -> { search: call 3 | calculate: call 5 | final: resume }
     3. Embed                    BGE-M3
     4. Retrieve     (1,3)       top_k=5
        resume
     5. Calculate
        resume
3. Save Text   findings.md
